--TEST--
a cursor on a method parameter declared bare `callable` whose every call passes an `fn(int): string` is offered Write the type every caller passes, which replaces the bare type with `callable(int): string` alone, `rule:ide/a-code-action-writes-only-what-is-already-determined`
--FILE--
<?nvs
final class Report {
    public function render(call<|>able $format, int $n): mixed {
        return $format($n);
    }
}

Report $report = new Report();
echo $report->render(fn(int $n): string => "Total: {$n}", 3);
echo $report->render(fn(int $n): string => "Count: {$n}", 7);
--REQUEST--
codeAction
--EXPECT--
3:27-3:53 refactor.rewrite Put on separate lines -> "(\n        callable $format,\n        int $n,\n    )"
3:28-3:36 refactor.rewrite Write the type every caller passes: `callable(int): string` -> "callable(int): string"
